# Robot logs. One 3-minute run is about 5 MB and there are dozens; they are
# raw measurements, not source, and they belong next to the notes rather than
# in the library's history. The fitted parameters they produce ARE committed.
data/*.arrow
data/run_*.csv
plots/
# The bench data from scripts/drive_calibration.jl: 1.7 MB per motor, 1 kHz for
